From: FVOCI <150913557+fvoci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:10:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] test(web): give the compare race revisions an edited_by_names

For the #64 update commit (after #57 is merged). NEW in W13, not a
pre-check item: #64's D-95 change (0446746) makes RevisionView carry
edited_by_names, which #57's revision-compare-race fixture lacks
(svelte-check: property 'edited_by_names' is missing; vitest: 3 failures,
'Cannot read properties of undefined (reading length)'). Use null, a
plain revision, as #64's own revision-restore-conflict fixture does.
Integration rehearsal W13; not pushed to any PR branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/web/tests/component/revision-compare-race.test.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/apps/web/tests/component/revision-compare-race.test.ts b/apps/web/tests/component/revision-compare-race.test.ts
index 4063caf..9b06d79 100644
--- a/apps/web/tests/component/revision-compare-race.test.ts
+++ b/apps/web/tests/component/revision-compare-race.test.ts
@@ -29,6 +29,7 @@ function revisionAt(revision: number): RevisionView {
     author_name: '나',
     created_at: '2026-10-19T00:00:00Z',
     restored_from: null,
+    edited_by_names: null,
     body: paragraph(TEXT[revision] ?? ''),
     schema_version: 1,
   };
